00:10:08,110 --> 00:10:12,210
在非常激进的主动性之后，极端点的不平衡成交量意味着耗尽点
you know that an imbalance at an extreme signals an exhaustion point.

207
00:10:12,730 --> 00:10:15,170
记住，耗尽点并不意味着顶部
Remember, an exhaustion point does not mean a top.

208
00:10:15,650 --> 00:10:18,206
耗尽点仅表示市场已达到一个点现在需要休整，且高概率
An exhaustion point simply means the market has reached a point

209
00:10:18,206 --> 00:10:21,460
where it now needs to take a break, and there’s a high probability

210
00:10:21,461 --> 00:10:23,088
它会暂停休整。
it’s going to take a break.

211
00:10:23,370 --> 00:10:24,670
这就是第二个例子。
So, that's the second example.

212
00:10:24,770 --> 00:10:28,210
现在注意，我们是从这里观察不平衡成交量的。
Now, note again, that's where we view the imbalances from.

213
00:10:29,450 --> 00:10:35,650
最后一个例子类似不平衡成交量，但属于高成交量不平衡。
The last example is similar to the imbalance, except it's a high-volume imbalance.

215
00:10:37,470 --> 00:10:43,430
这在活跃市场中常见，比如债券市场、E-mini S&P。
And you see this in the thicker markets, like the bond markets, the E-mini S&Ps.

217
00:10:43,930 --> 00:10:49,925
但高成交量不平衡，仅指成交量激增，相对成交量极高。
But a high-volume imbalance is simply where we churn over an aggressive amount of volume, a high relative volume.

219
00:10:49,925 --> 00:10:52,449
你会看到非常深的颜色。
So, you're going to see very dark colors.

220
00:10:53,810 --> 00:10:55,310
我在这里画个图。
Let me draw it here.

221
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:59,950
还是上涨的例子。
Again, an example of going up.

222
00:11:00,370 --> 00:11:13,670
比如S&P，可能看到3,000、500、2,500、1,600、4,000、800手。
Maybe the S&P. You’re going to see 3,000, 500, 2,500, maybe 1,600, 4000, and maybe 800.

225
00:11:17,430 --> 00:11:24,810
同样，能看到不平衡，买盘非常激进。
So, again, we can see the imbalance, a real aggressive amount of buying.

227
00:11:24,810 --> 00:11:30,230
但注意，这种情况下，激进买盘遇到什么？流动性。
But note in this example, the buying, the aggressive buying, is being met by what? Liquidity.

230
00:11:37,550 --> 00:11:43,650
因此，要么显示0，即止损单，要么显示低成交量不平衡。
Therefore, it either shows zeros, which are stops, or it shows the imbalance with low volume.

232
00:11:44,330 --> 00:11:50,190
如果有高成交量或高流动性提供，在极端点会出现高成交量不平衡。
If there's high volume or high liquidity being provided, you will see a high-volume imbalance at the extreme.

234
00:11:50,190 --> 00:11:56,730
这就是你会看到的耗尽高点或低点的三种变体。
So, these are the three variations of an exhaustion high or low that you can expect to see.

236
00:11:57,690 --> 00:12:00,082
现在注意另一种情况，你可以关注的是Delta分歧。
Now, note one of the other ones,

237
00:12:00,082 --> 00:12:03,157
but again, this is something you can look into,

238
00:12:03,157 --> 00:12:05,207
is when we get delta divergences.

239
00:12:09,330 --> 00:12:11,754
如第4单元所示，我们讲K线概念时，我展示过Delta的K线图，如果价格上涨，但Delta却反向而行，实际上，我们正接近耗尽高点或低点。
As I showed you in Unit 4,

240
00:12:11,754 --> 00:12:14,986
when we spoke about the concept of bars,

241
00:12:14,986 --> 00:12:21,046
A bar chart for the delta, I showed you that if all of a sudden

242
00:12:21,046 --> 00:12:26,702
prices are going higher, but the delta is actually going in the opposite direction,

243
00:12:26,702 --> 00:12:31,146
then in effect, we are approaching an exhaustion high or low.

247
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:33,132
现在注意——非常重要——在Delta分歧的例子中，你很可能会在高成交量不平衡的例子中看到它。
Now, note—so important—

248
00:12:33,132 --> 00:12:38,584
is in the example of a divergence of the delta bars,

249
00:12:38,584 --> 00:12:45,027
you’re most likely going to see that in a high-volume imbalance example.

251
00:12:45,230 --> 00:12:48,288
为什么？因为有人提供流动性时，
Why? Because what occurs here when someone’s providing liquidity

252
00:12:48,288 --> 00:12:51,345
他们不仅在应对高价，还在最佳买价大量抛售。
is not only are they responding to the high prices,

253
00:12:51,345 --> 00:12:54,707
but they’re equally selling a lot into the best bid.

254
00:12:54,710 --> 00:13:01,290
实际上，最佳买价的卖盘多于买盘。
In effect, there is more selling taking place at the best bid than there is buying occurring.

257
00:13:01,910 --> 00:13:05,910
因此，Delta分歧时，你通常会在高成交量不平衡的例子中看到。
That’s why sometimes with these delta divergences,

258
00:13:05,910 --> 00:13:10,410
you’ll most likely see them with the example

259
00:13:10,410 --> 00:13:12,410
of the high-volume imbalance.

260
00:13:12,410 --> 00:13:15,095
这就是你可能看到耗尽高点或低点的例子。
Those are the examples where you can expect to see an exhaustion high or low.

261
00:13:15,095 --> 00:13:20,735
策略很简单：第一步，识别趋势、主导方向和布林带（Bollinger Bands）
It’s as simple as this: One, you identify the trend, the initiative, and the Bollinger Band.

263
00:13:20,735 --> 00:13:28,051
市场到达超买或超卖后，寻找零成交量
Once the market reaches a point of overbought or oversold, we’re then looking for zeros.

265
00:13:28,051 --> 00:13:31,492
寻找不平衡成交量，可能是高成交量或低成交量或者寻找Delta分歧
We’re looking for an imbalance,

266
00:13:31,492 --> 00:13:36,080
and that imbalance can be high- or low-volume,

267
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:45,810
看到其中一个信号，就很简单了
If you see one of those, it’s very simple.

269
00:13:47,510 --> 00:13:53,114
第一步：我要告诉你，逆势交易有风险
Step one: what I am going to say to you is fading can be dangerous.

270
00:13:53,114 --> 00:13:55,729
而且难度很大
It can be quite difficult as well.

271
00:13:57,110 --> 00:13:59,825
所以我建议你，从后面的例子会看到如果要逆势交易，让市场先触及高点
So, what I'm going to suggest, as you'll see in the examples,

272
00:13:59,825 --> 00:14:02,767
if you are going to fade, let the market ping at the high.

274
00:14:03,310 --> 00:14:06,530
让它触发后，回调时再做空
Let it go off it, and when it comes back, sell it there.

275
00:14:06,670 --> 00:14:08,526
注意，别在下跌途中做空否则会增加风险。好，这是第一种选择
Okay, don’t sell it on the way down,

276
00:14:08,526 --> 00:14:09,557
otherwise you're increasing your risk.

277
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:13,190
即在回测高点时逆势交易
to fade on a retest high.

278
00:14:13,990 --> 00:14:17,210
第二种选择是买入首次回调
Your second option is to buy the first pullback.

279
00:14:18,930 --> 00:14:21,470
这可能是概率最高的机会
Okay, and this is probably the highest probability opportunity.

280
00:14:21,850 --> 00:14:28,590
回调后看到吸纳，直接做多，等待小反弹
So, once it pulls back and we see the absorption, we simply get long, looking for that little bounce.

282
00:14:29,670 --> 00:14:33,330
第三种？抱歉，其实只有这两种机会
And our third... Oh, actually, sorry. Those are the only opportunities, okay?

283
00:14:33,450 --> 00:14:39,530
所以首先是逆势交易，但最高概率是买入首次回调
So, it’s first and foremost the fade, but the highest probability is to buy that first pullback opportunity.

285
00:14:39,530 --> 00:14:41,130
现在，我们先确认一下
Now, let’s just establish

286
00:14:42,608 --> 00:14:45,565
我知道第3单元讲过这部分
I know we went over this in Unit 3, but just to understand

287
00:14:49,770 --> 00:14:53,450
第一种是获利了结
One is profit-taking, okay?

288
00:14:53,710 --> 00:14:59,710
第二种是均值回归。也就是说，市场过度延伸时
And two is mean reversion. In other words, when a market does overextend,

289
00:14:59,930 --> 00:15:03,192
会有算法来逆势交易当市场到达极端点位时
there are algorithms that are created to fade the market

290
00:15:03,192 --> 00:15:07,107
when we have reached a point that is a bit too extreme.

291
00:15:07,110 --> 00:15:12,150
所以会出现突破。第三种交易机会
Okay, so that’s why we get that break. What I would say, as a third trade opportunity,

292
00:15:12,930 --> 00:15:15,996
可能最难，但在高成交量失衡的例子中会留下假突破高点或低点。突破结束后
okay, this is probably the most difficult,

293
00:15:15,996 --> 00:15:21,690
however, is that very often, in the example of a high volume imbalance,

294
00:15:21,690 --> 00:15:27,384
okay, we’re going to leave a bad high or a bad low.

295
00:15:27,384 --> 00:15:30,888
In which case, once the break is over,

296
00:15:31,170 --> 00:15:32,790
市场可能回调
the markets may be pulled back.

297
00:15:33,330 --> 00:15:35,863
一旦再次上涨，就会给出你需要的线索然后寻找延伸和持续信号
Once it starts to move higher again,

298
00:15:35,863 --> 00:15:38,758
it gives the kind of clues you need,

299
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:44,549
现在注意这个技巧，好吗？
Now, note the tip, okay?

300
00:15:45,650 --> 00:15:53,030
耗尽高点和低点是逆势交易或获利了结的更好时机，好吗？
Exhaustion highs and lows are a better way to time the fading markets, okay, or taking profits.

301
00:15:53,130 --> 00:16:00,570
换句话说，你仍可用逆势交易的部分方法，好吗？
In other words, you can keep using some of the approaches you have to fading a market, okay?

303
00:16:00,570 --> 00:16:03,144
但当市场出现耗尽高点或低点时，就像我刚才展示的，也像我后面要展示的例子，对我来说这是高概率时机，要么获利了结，要么寻找逆势交易机会
But when a market shows an exhaustion high or low,

304
00:16:03,144 --> 00:16:07,262
like I’ve just shown you and like I’m going to show you in examples,

305
00:16:07,262 --> 00:16:10,093
that for me is the high-probability time to either take profits,

306
00:16:10,093 --> 00:16:14,726
if you are long into it or short into it, or ultimately look for a potential fade opportunity.

309
00:16:15,810 --> 00:16:18,474
好，现在我们来看一些例子，看看足迹图上是什么样子
Okay, now, let’s go and have a look at some of the examples,

310
00:16:18,474 --> 00:16:20,567
and we can see what this looks like on the footprint.

311
00:16:20,570 --> 00:16:28,370
第一个例子：注意，我们总是从前置背景开始，好吗？
So first example: note, we always start off with pre-context, okay? We can see the imbalance,

313
00:16:29,070 --> 00:16:30,890
看到明显的不平衡成交量，大量止损单
quite a strong imbalance, quite a lot of stops.

314
00:16:31,690 --> 00:16:34,717
然后市场出现一点吸纳，一些响应性买盘，突然市场触发止损单
The market then has a little bit of absorption,

315
00:16:34,717 --> 00:16:37,071
a bit of responsive buying, and suddenly,

316
00:16:39,091 --> 00:16:41,109
注意这些0 × 30，
Note the zero, zero, zero, zero,

317
00:16:45,447 --> 00:16:50,429
高累计Delta，好吗？所以趋势第一阶段形成
high cumulative delta, okay? So we’ve got the trend—phase one.

318
00:16:51,130 --> 00:16:53,770
第二阶段，我们寻找信号
Phase two, we’re looking for, effectively, the signal.

319
00:16:53,770 --> 00:17:00,080
信号有三种形式：止损单触发、不平衡成交量、Delta分歧，好吗？
So we’re looking for the signal, which comes in three versions: stops, imbalance, delta divergence, okay?

320
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,483
止损单触发后，我们未必能拿到这些价格，我们寻找吸纳
Once those stops are in, like I said,

321
00:17:02,483 --> 00:17:06,087
we won’t necessarily be able to get any of these prices.

322
00:17:06,087 --> 00:17:07,889
We’re looking for the absorption

323
00:17:07,890 --> 00:17:14,750
然后买入并目标小幅反弹，注意
before we buy the market and target a little bit of a bounce. Note, like I said, on the bounce,

325
00:17:14,970 --> 00:17:17,758
反弹前要先看到吸纳才能做空
you’re looking for absorption before entering shorts.

326
00:17:17,758 --> 00:17:20,077
这个例子——注意——它回测了之前的高成交量区域，但并未在下跌前出现吸纳，好吗？
Now this example—note—it came and tested

327
00:17:20,077 --> 00:17:22,686
one of the high-volume areas that we left previously,

328
00:17:22,686 --> 00:17:25,875
but it didn’t really give absorption before offering lower, okay?

329
00:17:29,142 --> 00:17:32,082
but definitely gave us the opportunity to be long

330
00:17:32,082 --> 00:17:36,002
for a little bounce before then taking out and continuing lower, okay?

331
00:17:39,190 --> 00:17:44,580
现在注意，持续形态时要非常谨慎，好吗？
Now note, what I would say on the continuation example, be very cautious, okay?

332
00:17:44,580 --> 00:17:50,740
原因很简单：市场过度延伸时，
A simple reason is that when a market's overextended, it's overdone, it's oversold in this example,

333
00:17:50,740 --> 00:17:57,670
要维持趋势，要持续发起需要强势参与者继续主动操作
to continue trending, to continue initiating, is going to require some influential participants to continue to be aggressive.

336
00:17:58,130 --> 00:18:00,380
但并非不可能，当然他们能做到但通常，强势参与者会让市场或让机会先找到流动性，再继续推进
Now, it's not to say they can't;

337
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:02,630
of course they can, but very often,

338
00:18:02,630 --> 00:18:05,201
strong participants are going to allow the market

339
00:18:05,201 --> 00:18:08,737
or they're going to allow the opportunity to find some liquidity

340
00:18:14,167 --> 00:18:18,409
在主动策略中——反弹时，空头最终会退出
in the initiative strategy—when we bounce, ultimately, the sellers are going to back off, okay?

342
00:18:20,180 --> 00:18:23,479
所以如果你是大卖家，需要完成订单有人提供流动性时，你不会继续抛售这就是反弹的原因
So if you're a big seller and you need to get an order done,

343
00:18:23,479 --> 00:18:25,836
you're not going to keep selling if someone's providing liquidity,

344
00:18:25,836 --> 00:18:27,485
and that's why we get the bounce.

345
00:18:30,777 --> 00:18:34,189
他们再次退出，所以出现横盘
they back off again. And that's why we get the sideways mode, right?

346
00:18:34,470 --> 00:18:38,962
有时会延伸，但最终仍有流动性供应
Sometimes what happens is we do extend, but ultimately, there's still liquidity being provided.

348
00:18:38,962 --> 00:18:41,208
这就是你在这里看到的
And that's what you're seeing here, okay?

349
00:18:43,260 --> 00:18:44,724
仍有流动性供应——大量被动买家坐等最终你会看到他们被吃单
there's still liquidity being provided—

350
00:18:44,724 --> 00:18:47,066
quite a lot of passive buyers sitting there,

351
00:18:51,570 --> 00:18:55,970
注意这一点。最佳策略显然是第一次回调
Okay, so just be aware of that. The most profitable strategy is obviously the first pullback.

353
00:18:57,410 --> 00:19:02,930
显然，如果能抓住逆势机会，也可能盈利
And obviously, if you can get a little bit of a fade opportunity on, that could also be potentially profitable.

354
00:19:05,770 --> 00:19:07,990
现在看另一个例子
Okay, let's now have a look at another example.

355
00:19:10,790 --> 00:19:13,950
这是一个更强的例子
Okay, so again, this is a little bit of a stronger example.

358
00:19:18,450 --> 00:19:21,630
注意趋势性行情
Okay, so again, note the trend-like move.

359
00:19:21,710 --> 00:19:24,590
一根漂亮的绿色K线，实体饱满
Nice green candle, as you can see. Full-bodied candle.

361
00:19:27,510 --> 00:19:30,730
高位吸收，延续，再吸收
Absorption higher. Continuation. Absorption higher.

362
00:19:30,810 --> 00:19:32,270
这里买盘意图明确
The buy is real intentional here.

363
00:19:32,610 --> 00:19:33,850
Delta在上升
You can see the delta picking up.

364
00:19:34,010 --> 00:19:37,930
当日Delta为正，成交量也高
You can see a nice positive delta on the day. Also, high relative volume.

366
00:19:38,310 --> 00:19:42,630
这是12月20日EUR/USD 5分钟图
This is obviously the EUR/USD five-minute timeframe from the 20th of December.

368
00:19:43,350 --> 00:19:47,290
注意市场随即形成双重失衡
Now, note the market then creates a double imbalance.

369
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:52,150
先吸收，再制造失衡高点
Some absorption before creating an imbalanced high.

370
00:19:52,310 --> 00:19:56,970
看到失衡高点，寻找空头交易
When we see that imbalanced high, we’re looking for short-side trades.

372
00:19:57,070 --> 00:20:00,970
也可在吸收时买入第一次回调
We’re also looking to buy the first pullback on absorption.

374
00:20:01,050 --> 00:20:02,930
这依然是5分钟图
Again, this is a five-minute timeframe.

375
00:20:03,290 --> 00:20:06,770
在轮转时间框架下可能更容易识别
It probably would have been slightly easier to see on a rotational timeframe.

377
00:20:06,910 --> 00:20:09,990
但本质上，这就是你的买入时机
But in essence, that’s where you want to be buying.

379
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:13,190
最终这是一次强劲的反转
Ultimately, this was quite a strong reversal.

380
00:20:13,290 --> 00:20:18,290
你们中很多人应该会说，这是个很好的倒V型反转
A lot of you should be looking at this and saying, 'This was quite a good inverse V reversal.'

383
00:20:18,430 --> 00:20:22,770
可以看到被动买家介入，维持市场买价
We can see the passive buyers stepping in, holding the market bid.

385
00:20:23,110 --> 00:20:27,570
在下跌延伸前，还有Delta回升
Once they got taken out, notice the absorption below. Before the extension down. And the delta pickup.

388
00:20:27,970 --> 00:20:30,596
所以，这又是一个耗尽高点或低点的例子
So again, another example of an exhaustion high or low.

