00:20:40,250 --> 00:20:45,262
风险管理上，我们如何避免被套
Again, in terms of risk management, how we prevent ourselves from getting caught in this.

392
00:20:45,262 --> 00:20:48,269
在吸纳区执行交易后
It's simple. Once we're executing there on the absorption,

393
00:20:48,670 --> 00:20:51,310
只需关注高点回测
we simply want to be looking for a retest of the highs.

395
00:20:51,550 --> 00:20:53,546
为什么？
