00:20:53,546 --> 00:20:58,869
因为很简单：我们做多是基于多头会守住突破区
Well, it's simple. We're buying on the fact that buyers should be defending this breakout zone.

398
00:20:58,870 --> 00:21:03,520
如果他们不守，突然被压制我们就用一个较紧的止损离场
If they're not defending it and suddenly they start to become overwhelmed,

399
00:21:03,520 --> 00:21:07,007
we're simply stopping out for a relatively tight stop.

401
00:21:07,190 --> 00:21:14,070
这是轮转案例
Another example is the oil market. This is a rotational example.

