01:26:03,940 --> 01:26:08,140
注意，我提到过三种耗尽信号或线索：止损单触发/零成交量、极端区域不平衡成交量、Delta分歧。
Note, I have mentioned—I’ve included here—

615
01:26:08,140 --> 01:26:14,966
the three types of signals or clues of an exhaustion high or low:

616
01:26:14,966 --> 01:26:21,267
stops or zeros, an imbalance at the extreme, or a delta divergence.

618
01:26:21,270 --> 01:26:25,100
从指标看，成交量在极端点通常最高，你会看到——可能是总览柱上最深的成交量，以及极端点周围足迹图的旋转区域。
In terms of the metrics, note volume is usually the highest at the extreme,

619
01:26:25,100 --> 01:26:29,204
so you’re going to see that—probably the darkest volumes on your summary bar,

620
01:26:29,204 --> 01:26:32,487
as well as on the actual footprint rotations around the extreme point.

621
01:26:32,670 --> 01:26:35,570
逻辑很简单：止损触发、动能衰竭时，所有人都放弃了。
Very logically, when there are stops going off and there is exhaustion, everyone just gives up.

623
01:26:35,570 --> 01:26:38,470
所有人清仓，抓住能抓的流动性。
It’s the fact that everyone packs it in and just takes whatever liquidity they can.

625
01:26:43,730 --> 01:26:47,972
这会引发成交量和Delta的激增，累计差值、价格偏移、波动率、相对变化。
That’s what creates that surge of not just volume,

626
01:26:47,972 --> 01:26:51,366
but also delta, cumulative delta, price shift, volatility,

627
01:26:53,570 --> 01:26:55,870
这是非常快速的反转，如我举例所示。
it’s a very quick reversal, as I showed you in the examples.

628
01:26:56,190 --> 01:26:58,087
速度不会变慢。
It’s never going to get any slower.

629
01:26:58,087 --> 01:27:02,831
以前可能你有更多时间应对这些耗尽高点或低点，
Like I said, back in the day, maybe you had more time to respond to these exhaustion highs or lows.

630
01:27:02,831 --> 01:27:04,728
现在必须快速执行策略。
You have to be quick with the strategy.

631
01:27:04,730 --> 01:27:09,910
因为算法也在用同样的策略和你竞争。
Because you've got algorithms competing with you on the same strategy.

632
01:27:10,810 --> 01:27:15,130
注意，耗尽点的Delta最高，这源于流动性溢价。
And note, In terms of the delta, highest of the exhaustion, Like I said, due to liquidity premium.

634
01:27:15,130 --> 01:27:19,470
累计差值全天最高，出现在极端点。这非常典型。
Cumulative delta, highest of the day, at the extreme. It's very, very typical.

635
01:27:19,710 --> 01:27:24,221
你会看到最强正Delta，或最弱负累计差值。一旦形成耗尽高点或低点。
You're going to see either the most positive delta

636
01:27:24,221 --> 01:27:29,735
Or the most negative delta in terms of the cumulative delta,

637
01:27:29,735 --> 01:27:34,246
Once we have that exhaustion high or low gained.

639
01:27:34,250 --> 01:27:41,850
买卖互动的性质会彻底改变。
You will see the nature of buying and selling interaction Become very, very different.

641
01:27:42,010 --> 01:27:44,170
相对变化方面，价格上最明显。
In terms of relative change, obviously, You'll see it most aggressively in terms of price.

642
01:27:44,270 --> 01:27:50,070
这可能是耗尽高点或低点的真实信号。
This is probably the real signal Of an exhaustion high and low.

644
01:27:50,390 --> 01:27:52,030
价格动态会急剧转变。但显然，相对变化也存在
The price dynamic shifts very aggressively. But we do see, obviously, relative changes

645
01:27:52,030 --> 01:27:55,802
在高成交量、Delta 和波动率中都能看到。
In both high volume and, obviously, delta and volatility.

646
01:27:55,802 --> 01:27:57,897
好的，我们继续。
Okay, let's now move on

647
01:28:04,050 --> 01:28:10,150
执行和资金管理方面，必须非常果断，非常有意图。
In terms of execution and money management, Obviously, note—like I said—very aggressive, very intentional.

649
01:28:10,330 --> 01:28:16,730
这个策略你必须快，逆势交易和首次回调都一样。
You have to be quick on this one, Both on the fade as well as that first pullback.

651
01:28:16,770 --> 01:28:19,110
取决于你交易的市场，流动性好的市场会多给你点时间。
Depending on the market you're trading, obviously, The thicker markets will give you slightly more time.

652
01:28:19,190 --> 01:28:23,531
而流动性差的市场，比如黄金、原油、天然气等，给你的时间会非常少。
Whereas, the thinner markets—like gold, oil, Natural gas, and all that—

653
01:28:23,531 --> 01:28:26,787
they're going to give you a lot less time.

654
01:28:26,790 --> 01:28:29,930
再次强调，根据你交易的市场来解读信号。
Again, just make sure You're interpreting this according to the market you're trading.

655
01:28:30,570 --> 01:28:34,490
止损设置很简单，你必须管理止损。
Risk stop placement, very simple. You have to manage a stop.

657
01:28:34,570 --> 01:28:39,470
如果你逆势交易，得清楚自己在做反向，止损设在高点上方。
If you're fading the market, be aware you're fading the market. Keep that stop above that high.

659
01:28:39,570 --> 01:28:42,210
如果创新高或新低，直接出场，别犹豫。
If it makes a new high or low, Just get out. Don't ask questions.

661
01:28:42,350 --> 01:28:49,730
确保用自动止损，不是手动止损，必须自动止损。首次回调方面，
Make sure you're keeping automated stops, not manual stops, automated stops. Okay? In terms of the first pullback,

663
01:28:50,070 --> 01:28:51,530
我们寻找吸纳迹象。
Again, we're looking for that bit of absorption.

664
01:28:51,990 --> 01:28:53,190
一旦出现，立即入场。
Once we see it, we get in.

665
01:28:53,190 --> 01:28:57,290
如果市场朝有利方向运行，止损设在吸纳区下方。
If the market does rotate in our favor, we simply place a stop below where that absorption was.

667
01:28:57,290 --> 01:29:00,750
目标设置方面，要非常精确。
Now, in terms of target, it's very measured.

668
01:29:01,050 --> 01:29:04,490
如果逆势交易，寻找小目标，非常特殊的目标。
If we are fading, we're looking for something very small, something very unique.

670
01:29:04,610 --> 01:29:07,550
可能是爆发前的高成交量假突破。
Maybe a little high-volume error before the explosive move.

671
01:29:08,450 --> 01:29:11,670
甚至可能是不平衡成交量区作为目标。
Maybe even a little imbalance area as a target.

672
01:29:12,190 --> 01:29:17,490
如果首次回调买入，别期望延伸，必须谨慎。
If we are obviously buying the first pullback again, don’t expect an extension. Okay? Be very cautious.

674
01:29:17,610 --> 01:29:19,992
记住，市场到达耗尽点后，继续沿趋势运行的可能性很低。
Remember, when a market reaches that point of exhaustion,

675
01:29:19,992 --> 01:29:23,168
it’s very unlikely it’s going to continue in the trend.

676
01:29:23,170 --> 01:29:28,378
在那个时间点延伸趋势的可能性也很低。
It’s very unlikely it’s going to extend on that trend at that point in time.

677
01:29:28,378 --> 01:29:33,410
耗尽市场需要休整，所以目标要相应调整，明白了吗？
Exhausted markets take a break, which means that your targets need to be adjusted accordingly. Okay?

679
01:29:33,470 --> 01:29:37,070
如果快速回调买入，记住，目标要紧凑。
So, if you are buying a quick little pullback, just remember, keep it tight.

681
01:29:37,170 --> 01:29:39,807
止损也要紧凑。
Keep the target tight as well as the stop.

682
01:29:39,807 --> 01:29:43,030
显然，两者都有很好的风险收益比，原因充分。
Obviously, both have got very good risk-reward metrics for good reason.

683
01:29:43,870 --> 01:29:50,650
注意时间点，是精确时机。清楚了？两个案例都是精确时机。
Do note, in terms of timing, it’s exact timing. Okay? Both examples, we have exact timing.

685
01:29:50,930 --> 01:29:53,230
价格很重要，因为我们获利较小。
Price is important because we are taking smaller winners.

686
01:29:53,510 --> 01:29:56,350
所以要考虑进去。至于杠杆，
So, do just factor that in. And in terms of leveraging,

687
01:29:56,610 --> 01:29:59,210
我们绝不偏移，绝不用杠杆。为什么？
we definitely don’t skew. We definitely don’t leverage. Why?

688
01:29:59,410 --> 01:30:01,270
因为时机很重要。
Because timing is important.

689
01:30:01,750 --> 01:30:05,170
而且变化太快，我们承担不起杠杆。
And obviously, it happens so quick, we can’t afford to leverage.

691
01:30:05,350 --> 01:30:11,270
否则最终风险会超出应有范围。清楚了？这个策略的建议：
Because we will be taking on, ultimately, more risk than we should be. Okay? My tip for this strategy:

693
01:30:11,710 --> 01:30:16,870
耗尽高点和低点，是逆势交易延伸行情的最佳时机。清楚了？
Exhaustion highs and lows are the best way to time fading an extended market move. Okay?

696
01:30:16,870 --> 01:30:21,529
如果你发现自己总在逆势交易，而且总是失败，只是因为你找了各种理由去卖或买一个趋势市场，但就是不奏效，那耗尽高点和低点是学习逆势交易衰竭市场的极好工具。
If you're someone who has just found yourself fading a market and you really struggle,

697
01:30:21,529 --> 01:30:26,188
just because you're finding all these reasons to maybe sell or buy a trending market,

698
01:30:26,188 --> 01:30:33,332
but it never seems to work, exhaustion highs and lows are a very good timing tool to learn how to fade exhausted markets.

